5,1,1,talk,Victoria,,I think we should be careful about the operational side of these plans. I'll look into the roster books for the late-turn pool and the crew establishment and maintenance contract.,"{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Takumi,,I want to see if we're just repeating old mistakes. I'll check the completion records of the earlier accessibility programme and those two pilots from eight years ago.,"{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Toshio,,I'll examine the contingency pricing inside the pre-war shells and the joint operators' committee minutes to see where the real bottlenecks are.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,I... I think I should check the balances in the capital ledger and the ticketing contractor fees and paving rates. I want to see where the money is actually going.,"{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Sakura,,"I'll take the timed runs and crowd counts mid-city, and the journey audits on where minutes go! I want to see what's actually happening with the passengers!","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,pass,Victoria,,Skip,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Takumi,,Does anyone else think we should look at the pilots? I'm worried we're ignoring the past.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Takumi, you have already claimed the pilots. I believe your selection covers that concern sufficiently for now.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Daisuke,,"I... I agree with Toshio. We have a good spread of topics, so maybe we should just proceed.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Sakura,,"I'm just so excited to see the data! I think we've got everything covered, so I'm happy to move forward!","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,pass,Victoria,,Skip,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Takumi,,I'll stick with my choices then. I just hope the records actually tell us why things failed.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,pass,Toshio,,Skip,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Daisuke,,I just hope the budget figures are clear... it's always so confusing when they start moving funds around.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Sakura,,"I'm sure they'll be clear, Daisuke! Let's just get to the information!","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
